ed before code edits due to scope guardrail. Plan-review passed/certified and the ticket was claimed. The required internal-shim census found stale references that appear to require edits outside declared file_impact (`tests/unit`, `docs`, `src/rebar/llm/**`): `scripts/calibrate_completion_floor.py`, `scripts/jira_dc_capability_map.py`, `src/rebar/_config_resolvers.py`, `tests/interfaces/store/test_snapshot_environments.py`, `tests/interfaces/store/test_gate_ticket_snapshot.py`, `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_execution_floor_lifecycle.py`, `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py`, `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_sign_transaction_lifecycle.py`, `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_ref_coherence.py`, `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_completion_budget.py`, `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_plan_review_prerequisite_isolation.py`, `tests/fixtures/cloud_adf_corpus/bodies_02.json`, plus docs fixture/prose references under allowed docs. Per ticket instruction, I am stopping for a scope correction rather than editing one-at-a-time.","timestamp":1788542287451942166},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Second stop: after the authorized file_impact expansion, implementation uncovered one genuinely required production consumer outside the 13 declared surfaces: `src/rebar/llm/gate_source.py`. It imports `current_ticket_view` / `gate_session` from `rebar.llm.config`; once `config.py` stops re-exporting gate-context internals, this must migrate to `rebar.llm.gate_context`. Whole-tree census for the related gate-context stale import pattern found only this genuine code consumer; other matches are prose/comments in `scripts/jira_dc_capability_map.py`, `docs/repo-snapshot-gates.md`, and `tests/unit/test_gate_context_seam.py`. Per guardrail, stopping for scope correction before editing `gate_source.py`.","timestamp":1788543615674028325},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Implementation and migration are locally lint/typecheck clean; focused shim/plan-review tests pass; held-out mutation teeth passed. STOPPING before commit/push because full local preflight has a reproducible failure outside this ticket's LLM/file-impact scope: tests/interfaces/test_rebar_repo_isolation.py::test_copy_repoints_sibling_origin_and_keeps_refs_isolated. Exact assertion: copied_origin resolves to .../source/origin.git but expected .../destination/origin.git ('the copied store still pushes to its template topology\\''s origin'). Targeted reproduction fails with the same assertion. No --force used.","timestamp":1788550860451015001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1788314857187211001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"cb837aaf-ec14-40b4-8e75-066c0b50f2c0","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"8eff-87c1-d09a-4893"},{"link_uuid":"d700cb6f-426e-4a1c-a201-2585ab68d469","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"c2a4-5e7e-ffff-4fac"},{"link_uuid":"6bb30648-6189-42c4-b679-02f53e403303","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"d4ee-d290-0ac6-4967"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\nPrivate aliases remain across plan-review orchestrator sizing/context/move registries, runner Anthropic/tool/structured-run names, workflow gate-dispatch recovery names, and `llm.config` gate-context names. `llm.usage_log.failure_usage` also misnames the neutral `run_shape` record and has live callers. The governing private-shim policy is the direct prerequisite ADR `earthen-wheat-chick`; the parent container is ordered after the LLM configuration-reader extraction.\n\n## Approach\n\nAfter the prerequisite ADR and configuration-reader extraction complete, migrate every consumer to `plan_review.sizing`, `context_assembly`, `passes`, `anthropic_model`, `runner_support`, `structured_run`, `workflow.plan_review_recovery`, and `llm.gate_context`. Rename `failure_usage` completely to `run_shape` and prove emitted dictionaries and durable JSONL rows are byte/field identical. Remove each old private binding only after semantic and raw dynamic/monkeypatch census is empty.\n\n## Scope\n\n- plan-review, runner, workflow-dispatch, and gate-context private re-exports\n- usage-log implementation, callers, docs, experiment prose, and JSONL tests\n- all source/test/string/dynamic/monkeypatch consumers\n\n## Testing\n\nRun focused plan-review/workflow/runner suites; compare old/new usage record dictionaries and JSONL rows across success and failure paths; run semantic and raw reference scans.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] Every enumerated old LLM/workflow private binding has no repository consumer and its named canonical owner is the sole binding.\n- [x] `failure_usage` is absent and `run_shape` owns all former behavior.\n- [x] Success and failure records retain byte/field-identical dictionaries and durable JSONL rows after the rename.\n- [x] Gate-context, plan-review recovery, runner, and workflow behavior remain covered by focused tests.\n- [x] Static, string, dynamic-import, `getattr`, and monkeypatch census proves old paths absent.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/plan_review","reason":"remove sizing/context/move-registry compatibility bindings"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/runner.py","reason":"remove private support aliases"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/usage_log.py","reason":"rename failure_usage to run_shape"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/run_failure.py","reason":"migrate live usage callers"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/workflow","reason":"remove gate-dispatch/recovery private aliases"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/config.py","reason":"remove gate-context aliases after reader extraction"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/gate_context.py","reason":"canonical gate-context owner"},{"path":"src/rebar/_config_resolvers.py","reason":"migrate consumer of rebar.llm.plan_review.sizing (resolve_plan_review_budget) to canonical owner after shim removal"},{"path":"scripts/calibrate_completion_floor.py","reason":"migrate consumer importing rebar.llm.config/plan_review/runner to canonical owners"},{"path":"scripts/jira_dc_capability_map.py","reason":"migrate consumer importing rebar.llm gate_source/config/runner to canonical owners"},{"path":"tests/unit","reason":"migrate tests/patches and prove JSONL parity"},{"path":"tests/interfaces","reason":"migrate interface consumers (contracts/lifecycle/store/facades) of the migrated llm/plan_review/workflow/gate_context symbols; preserve observable contract behavior"},{"path":"docs","reason":"migrate maintained/experiment prose (NOT docs/adr — owned by concurrent ADR work)"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/gate_source.py","reason":"migrate gate-context imports from rebar.llm.config to rebar.llm.gate_context after config re-exports removed"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["depends_on","8eff-87c1-d09a-4893"],["parent","6640-ac11-5c55-46b5"],["relates_to","c2a4-5e7e-ffff-4fac"],["relates_to","d4ee-d290-0ac6-4967"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"6640-ac11-5c55-46b5","parent_status_uuid":"83e795a8-f0e4-46dc-ab47-c3433a53b050","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["janitor","llm","workflow","internal-shims"],"ticket_id":"2164-97a8-ca89-4546","ticket_type":"story","title":"Migrate and remove LLM, plan-review, and workflow internal shims","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["b0ae51b4-b54c-43c8-9848-1f75d64101e5","da73f8f0-9b9a-4b77-b5a7-fecd1e7e4941","93c0a644-1d25-4b8f-85c0-daa09adfa68f","33e699d2-1061-4610-b76b-40b86058d3ad","f0c3d6f7-23a2-4ccb-afc0-ec3418e67b22","4133a7ff-ae78-4351-8628-39851a306d38","5feea86b-130a-45df-9ceb-be35010964a0","d0712c7a-51c6-4b2a-96df-e335497b3e3f","d700cb6f-426e-4a1c-a201-2585ab68d469","6bb30648-6189-42c4-b679-02f53e403303","4bfc642a-f26f-4a43-8fb9-1e0c4b